		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00001 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e00001-s " data-id="e00001" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00001">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00002 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e00002-s " data-id="e00002" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00002">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00003 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e00003-s " data-id="e00003" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00003">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00004-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00004">Dispatchbox</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00005-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00005">Newsletter publishing</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00006 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-17n6hfi-e00006-s " data-id="e00006" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00006">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00007 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e00007-s " data-id="e00007" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00007">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00008-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00008">Est. 2026 · Flat fee · Leave whenever</p>
					<h1 data-interaction-id="e00009" class="e-17n6hfi-e00009-s e-heading-base">Six promises, and the mechanism behind each one.</h1>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0000a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000a">Dispatchbox is a newsletter platform for writers who have been burned. Flat pricing, no growth network, no emails sent to your list that you did not write, and an export that actually restores somewhere else.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0000b-s " data-id="e0000b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000b">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0000c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000c"><a href="#move" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Move your list
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0000d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000d"><a href="#export" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Read the export file first
	</a></p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0000e-s " data-id="e0000e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000e">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0000f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000f">Index</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0000g-s " data-id="e0000g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000g">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0000h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000h">01</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0000i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000i"><a href="#promises" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Six promises
	</a></p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0000j-s " data-id="e0000j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000j">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0000k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000k">02</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0000l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000l"><a href="#export" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		The export file, byte by byte
	</a></p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0000m-s " data-id="e0000m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000m">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0000n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000n">03</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0000o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000o"><a href="#network" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		No recommendation network
	</a></p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0000p-s " data-id="e0000p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000p">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0000q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000q">04</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0000r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000r"><a href="#deliverability" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Deliverability and your domain
	</a></p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0000s-s " data-id="e0000s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000s">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0000t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000t">05</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0000u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000u"><a href="#take-rate" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Paid subscriptions, and the take rate
	</a></p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0000v-s " data-id="e0000v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000v">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0000w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000w">06</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0000x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000x"><a href="#migration" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Migration from the big three
	</a></p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0000y-s " data-id="e0000y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000y">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0000z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000z">07</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00010-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00010"><a href="#bad-at" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		What we are bad at
	</a></p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00011 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e00011-s " data-id="e00011" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00011">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00012-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00012">08</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00013-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00013"><a href="#move" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Move your list
	</a></p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00014 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e00014-s " data-id="e00014" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00014" id="promises">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00015 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e00015-s " data-id="e00015" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00015">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00016 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-17n6hfi-e00016-s " data-id="e00016" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00016">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00017 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e00017-s " data-id="e00017" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00017">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00018-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00018">01</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00019 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e00019-s " data-id="e00019" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00019">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0001a" class="e-17n6hfi-e0001a-s e-heading-base">The promises, indexed. Each one is a mechanism, not a sentiment.</h2>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0001b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001b">A promise you cannot verify is marketing. Every line below names the thing that would have to be built for us to break it, and it is not built.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0001c-s " data-id="e0001c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001c">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001d e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-17n6hfi-e0001d-s " data-id="e0001d" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0001d">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001e" class="e-17n6hfi-e0001e-s e-heading-base">I.</h3>
					<h4 data-interaction-id="e0001f" class="e-17n6hfi-e0001f-s e-heading-base">We never email your subscribers.</h4>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0001g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001g">Not a digest, not a recommendation, not a we-noticed-you-have-not-opened. There is no code path that sends from your list except when you press send.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001h e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-17n6hfi-e0001h-s " data-id="e0001h" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0001h">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001i" class="e-17n6hfi-e0001i-s e-heading-base">II.</h3>
					<h4 data-interaction-id="e0001j" class="e-17n6hfi-e0001j-s e-heading-base">Your export is a single zip.</h4>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0001k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001k">Subscribers with signup date and source, every post as Markdown with its images, and your paid subscriber records with Stripe IDs intact. Download it any time without asking.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001l e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-17n6hfi-e0001l-s " data-id="e0001l" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0001l">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001m" class="e-17n6hfi-e0001m-s e-heading-base">III.</h3>
					<h4 data-interaction-id="e0001n" class="e-17n6hfi-e0001n-s e-heading-base">Flat price.</h4>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0001o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001o">£19 a month up to 25,000 subscribers, £49 above that. We do not take a percentage of your paid subscriptions and we never will.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001p e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-17n6hfi-e0001p-s " data-id="e0001p" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0001p">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001q" class="e-17n6hfi-e0001q-s e-heading-base">IV.</h3>
					<h4 data-interaction-id="e0001r" class="e-17n6hfi-e0001r-s e-heading-base">No recommendation network.</h4>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0001s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001s">We do not run one, we do not sell placement in one, and no widget under your posts points a reader at a writer who paid to be there.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001t e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-17n6hfi-e0001t-s " data-id="e0001t" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0001t">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001u" class="e-17n6hfi-e0001u-s e-heading-base">V.</h3>
					<h4 data-interaction-id="e0001v" class="e-17n6hfi-e0001v-s e-heading-base">Your domain, your reputation.</h4>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0001w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001w">Every send is authenticated to a domain you own. If you leave, the address your readers already trust leaves with you, warmed and intact.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001x e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-17n6hfi-e0001x-s " data-id="e0001x" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0001x">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001y" class="e-17n6hfi-e0001y-s e-heading-base">VI.</h3>
					<h4 data-interaction-id="e0001z" class="e-17n6hfi-e0001z-s e-heading-base">Ninety days of notice, in writing.</h4>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00020-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00020">Any change to price or policy reaches you three months early, written by a person, with the old terms honoured until the day it lands.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00021 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e00021-s " data-id="e00021" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00021" id="export">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00022 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-17n6hfi-e00022-s " data-id="e00022" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00022">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00023 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e00023-s " data-id="e00023" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00023">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00024-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00024">02 · The export file</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00025" class="e-17n6hfi-e00025-s e-heading-base">One zip. Here is what is inside it, byte by byte.</h2>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00026-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00026">No ticket, no waiting queue, no partial CSV with the paid records mysteriously missing. The button sits in your settings and works at three in the morning.</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00027-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00027">dispatchbox-export-2026-08-13.zip · 214 MB</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00028 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e00028-s " data-id="e00028" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00028">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00029 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-17n6hfi-e00029-s " data-id="e00029" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00029">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0002a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002a">subscribers.csv</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0002b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002b">14,208 rows · email, name, signup_date, source, status, tags</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002c e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-17n6hfi-e0002c-s " data-id="e0002c" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0002c">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0002d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002d">posts/*.md</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0002e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002e">412 files · Markdown with front matter, footnotes and links preserved</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002f e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-17n6hfi-e0002f-s " data-id="e0002f" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0002f">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0002g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002g">posts/images/</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0002h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002h">1,904 files · original resolution, referenced by relative path</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002i e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-17n6hfi-e0002i-s " data-id="e0002i" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0002i">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0002j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002j">paid.csv</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0002k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002k">1,106 rows · stripe_customer_id, stripe_subscription_id, price, member_since</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002l e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-17n6hfi-e0002l-s " data-id="e0002l" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0002l">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0002m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002m">drafts/</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0002n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002n">everything unpublished, same Markdown as the posts directory</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002o e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-17n6hfi-e0002o-s " data-id="e0002o" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0002o">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0002p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002p">manifest.json</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0002q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002q">per-file checksums, schema version, export timestamp, row counts</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0002r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002r">Checksums so you can prove the file is whole. Schema documented at the same URL for as long as we exist.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0002s-s " data-id="e0002s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002s" id="network">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0002t-s " data-id="e0002t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002t">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0002u-s " data-id="e0002u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002u">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0002v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002v">03 · No recommendation network</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0002w" class="e-17n6hfi-e0002w-s e-heading-base">Your list is not inventory for someone else's growth.</h2>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002x e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-17n6hfi-e0002x-s " data-id="e0002x" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0002x">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0002y-s " data-id="e0002y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002y">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0002z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002z">What a growth network does</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00030-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00030">A subscriber who trusted you gets shown three other writers at the moment of signup. Your open rate becomes a currency someone else spends. When the network changes its ranking, your subscriber growth changes and nobody tells you why.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00031 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e00031-s " data-id="e00031" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00031">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00032-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00032">What Dispatchbox does</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00033-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00033">Nothing. There is no cross-promotion surface, no paid placement, no onboarding step that offers your reader a list of alternatives. We have no product that would let us do it, and building one would be a rewrite of the sending layer.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00034 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e00034-s " data-id="e00034" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00034" id="deliverability">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00035 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-17n6hfi-e00035-s " data-id="e00035" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00035">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00036 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e00036-s " data-id="e00036" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00036">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00037-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00037">04 · Deliverability</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00038" class="e-17n6hfi-e00038-s e-heading-base">Our IP policy, in the plainest words we have.</h2>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00039-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00039">Your newsletter sends from your own authenticated domain on a pool shared only with writers of similar volume and complaint rate. We publish our pool complaint rates monthly.</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0003a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003a">SPF, DKIM and DMARC are set up during import and checked before your first send. A list with a bad month is moved to its own pool rather than allowed to sit next to yours, and we will tell you if that list is you.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0003b-s " data-id="e0003b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003b">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0003c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003c">Pool report · July 2026</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0003d-s " data-id="e0003d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003d">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0003e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003e">Complaint rate</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0003f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003f">0.021%</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0003g-s " data-id="e0003g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003g">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0003h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003h">Inbox placement</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0003i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003i">98.4%</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0003j-s " data-id="e0003j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003j">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0003k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003k">Bounce rate</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0003l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003l">0.34%</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0003m-s " data-id="e0003m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003m">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0003n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003n">Pools in operation</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0003o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003o">14</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0003p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003p">Published on the first working day of every month, including the months it looks bad.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0003q-s " data-id="e0003q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003q" id="take-rate">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003r e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-17n6hfi-e0003r-s " data-id="e0003r" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0003r">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0003s-s " data-id="e0003s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003s">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0003t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003t">0%</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0003u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003u">of your paid subscriptions, taken by us</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0003v-s " data-id="e0003v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003v">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0003w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003w">05 · Paid subscriptions</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0003x" class="e-17n6hfi-e0003x-s e-heading-base">The actual take rate, and the bill it replaces.</h2>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0003y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003y">Payments run through your own Stripe account. Your subscribers' cards, your payout schedule, your customer records. Stripe takes its usual fee and we take none of it.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0003z-s " data-id="e0003z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003z">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00040 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e00040-s " data-id="e00040" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00040">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00041-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00041">Up to 25,000 subscribers</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00042-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00042">£19 / month</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00043 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e00043-s " data-id="e00043" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00043">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00044-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00044">Above 25,000 subscribers</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00045-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00045">£49 / month</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00046 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e00046-s " data-id="e00046" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00046">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00047-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00047">Percentage of revenue, at any tier</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00048-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00048">None</p>
		
</div>

</div>
			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00049-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00049">A writer billing £4,000 a month in subscriptions pays us £49. On a ten percent platform that same writer pays £400, every month, forever, for the same sending.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0004a-s " data-id="e0004a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004a" id="migration">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0004b-s " data-id="e0004b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004b">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004c e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-17n6hfi-e0004c-s " data-id="e0004c" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0004c">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0004d-s " data-id="e0004d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004d">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0004e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004e">06 · Migration</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0004f" class="e-17n6hfi-e0004f-s e-heading-base">Eleven minutes, and a dry run you can read first.</h2>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0004g-s " data-id="e0004g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004g">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0004h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004h">Import from the three big platforms in about eleven minutes, including paid subscribers and their Stripe billing, with a dry run you can inspect before anything moves. Nothing sends, nothing charges, nothing is deleted anywhere else.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004i e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-17n6hfi-e0004i-s " data-id="e0004i" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0004i">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0004j-s " data-id="e0004j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004j">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004k" class="e-17n6hfi-e0004k-s e-heading-base">Substack</h3>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0004l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004l">11 min</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0004m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004m">Posts, subscribers, comments and paid tiers, with Stripe billing continuing on the same cards.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0004n-s " data-id="e0004n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004n">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004o" class="e-17n6hfi-e0004o-s e-heading-base">beehiiv</h3>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0004p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004p">9 min</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0004q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004q">Segments and signup sources map across as tags. Automations are listed, not silently recreated.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0004r-s " data-id="e0004r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004r">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004s" class="e-17n6hfi-e0004s-s e-heading-base">Mailchimp</h3>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0004t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004t">14 min</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0004u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004u">Campaign archive becomes posts. Merge fields become subscriber fields you can still read.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0004v-s " data-id="e0004v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004v" id="bad-at">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004w e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-17n6hfi-e0004w-s " data-id="e0004w" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0004w">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0004x-s " data-id="e0004x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004x">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0004y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004y">07 · What we are bad at</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0004z" class="e-17n6hfi-e0004z-s e-heading-base">The list of things we will disappoint you about.</h2>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00050 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e00050-s " data-id="e00050" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00050">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00051-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00051">We are bad at: landing page design, native video, and anything resembling a CRM. If you need a funnel, we are the wrong tool and we would rather tell you now.</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00052-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00052">There is no lead scoring, no drip sequence builder, no behavioural trigger that emails a reader because of something they did not do. Several of those are on the list of things we will not build, which is the same list as promise I.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00053 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e00053-s " data-id="e00053" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00053" id="move">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00054 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e00054-s " data-id="e00054" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00054">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00055 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-17n6hfi-e00055-s " data-id="e00055" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00055">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00056 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e00056-s " data-id="e00056" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00056">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00057-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00057">08 · Move your list</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00058" class="e-17n6hfi-e00058-s e-heading-base">Bring it over. Leave with all of it whenever you like.</h2>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e00059-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00059"><a href="#promises" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Move your list
	</a></p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0005a-s " data-id="e0005a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005a">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0005b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005b">Import runs as a dry run first. The export button is live from the first minute of the trial, before you have paid us anything, because a promise you can only test on the way out is not a promise.</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0005c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005c">£19 a month · 14 day trial · no percentage, ever</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-17n6hfi-e0005d-s " data-id="e0005d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005d">
    			<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0005e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005e">Dispatchbox</p>
					<p class="e-17n6hfi-e0005f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005f">Six promises, and the mechanism behind each one.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
